{"strongs": "H0503", "word": "אֶ֫לֶף", "translit": "a.laph", "root": "אלף", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "thousand", "definition": "II. אֶ֫לֶף noun masculine Judg 6:15 thousand ( אלף MI , SI , Sabean DHM ZMG 1875, 615 ; Arabic , Aramaic , אֲלַף , אלפיא ) — ׳ ) א ׳ (אָ֑ Gen 20:16 +; suffix אַלְפִּי Judg 6:15 dual אַלְפַּיִם Num 4:36 +; plural אֲלָפִים Exod 18:21 +; construct אַלְפֵי Exod 32:28 +; אֲלָפֶיךָ Deut 7:13 + 2 t.; אֲלָפָיו Qr 1Sam 18:7 + 2 t. ( Kt פֿו ) — a thousand. 1. numeral: \\ \\ a. used with noun alone; mostly before noun Num 35:4 ; Josh 7:3 ; Neh 3:13 ; 1Chr 18:4 +; after noun (late) 1Chr 12:35 + 6 t. Chronicles Ezra Nehemiah; בָּאַפָּה ׳ א Num 35:5 (4 t. in verse); Ezek 47:3 (strike out Co ); the noun always plural when preceding, sometimes when following, 1Sam 25:2 ; 1Kgs 3:4 ; 2Kgs 18:23 = Isa 36:8 ; 2Chr 30:24 ; Ps 90:4 ; Job 42:12 ; Eccl 6:6 elsewhere singular אישׁ Judg 9:49 ; Judg 15:15 ; Judg 15:16 ; Josh 7:3 +; אַמָּה Num 35:4 + (so SI ); דּוֺר Deut 7:9 +, compare 1Chr 18:4 ; 1Chr 19:6 ; 2Kgs 15:19 ; Job 42:12 ; Song 4:4 ; Isa 7:23 , noun sometimes collective; ׳ א plural construct Mic 6:7 ; Ps 119:72 ; Gen 24:60 noun not expressed (or not fully) Gen 20:16 ; Num 31:5 ; Num 31:6 +; distributive אֶלֶף ֗֗֗ אֶלֶף Num 31:4 multiplicative Deut 1:11 פְּעָמִים ׳ א ; indefinite for great number (plural) Exod 20:6 ; Exod 34:7 ; Deut 5:10 ; Jer 32:18 , (singular) Deut 32:30 ; Eccl 6:6 +. \\ \\ b. ׳ א + other number usually precedes it Exod 38:25 + often; but following רִבּוֺא Ezra 2:64 + 2 t.; it follows also smaller number Num 3:50 ; 1Kgs 5:12 (so SI ); the noun following in singular Exod 28:25 + 8 t.; plural 2Sam 8:4 + 2 t.; noun precedes, in plural (late) Dan 12:12 + 2 t.; noun not expressed Exod 38:28 + often \\ \\ c. ׳ א X other number always following Exod 12:37 +; usual order is no. X ׳ א + additional no. (if any) + noun (if expressed) Num 31:52 ; Judg 20:35 compare Exod 12:37 ; 2Kgs 3:4 (twice in verse) +; less often noun + no. X ׳ א Num 31:33 ; 1Kgs 8:63 +; (other combinations see Exod 38:26 ; Num 26:51 ; Num 31:32 ; Ezek 48:30 ; 1Chr 29:7 etc.); ׳ א usually singular Num 11:21 +; except after units, where plural absolute Num 1:46 ; Judg 20:34 + (so MI ); seldom plural construct Exod 32:28 ; Judg 4:10 ; Job 1:3 (twice in verse); (noun mostly singular when following Judg 4:10 ; 1Kgs 12:21 +, yet plural Josh 4:13 ; 1Sam 13:5 +; when preceding it is plural 1Chr 5:21 +, or collective Num 31:33 ; 1Sam 25:2 ; 1Kgs 8:63 ; 2Chr 7:5 +); אֶלֶף אֲלָפִים 1Chr 21:5 ; 1Chr 22:14 ; 2Chr 14:8 אַלְפֵי שִׁנְאָן Ps 68:18 , compare שִׁנְאָן ; בְּהַרֲרֵי אָ֑לֶף Ps 50:10 , read אֵל compare Ps 36:7 , Ol Bi Che ; yet see Hup De. — Note. 10,000 = עֲשֶׂרֶת אֲלָפִים etc. Judg 1:4 ; Judg 3:29 ; 1Kgs 5:28 ; 1Chr 29:7 +; less often רִבּוֺ , רְבָבָה etc. q. v. 2. a thousand , a company of 1000 men, as united under one superior, or leader, hence ׳ (שָׂרֵי) שַׂר א Exod 18:21 ; Exod 18:25 compare Num 31:14 +; compare יִשְׂרָאֵל ׳ רָאשֵׁי א Num 1:16 ; Num 10:4 ; Josh 22:21 ; Josh 22:30 & see below; compare also 1Sam 29:2 especially family , etc. Judg 6:15 ; 1Sam 10:19 (|| שֵׁבֶט & compare מִשְׁפַּחַת v 1Sam 10:21 ); compare Mic 5:2 — Num 10:36 ( רִבְבוֺת אַלְפֵי יִשְׂרָאֵל ) Num 31:5 ; Josh 22:14 ; 1Sam 23:23 apparently shew transition to this technical use. ** [ אָלַף ] verb denominative Hiph`il Ps 144:13 מַאֲלִיפוֺת producing thousands (subject צאֹן ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB504')\">BDB504</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H503')\">H503</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H505')\">H505</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB503')\">BDB503</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB505')\">BDB505</entry></div><p> II. <bdbheb>אֶ֫לֶף</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Judg 6:15\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(7,6,15)\">Judg 6:15</ref></sup> <highlightword>thousand</highlightword> (<bdbheb>אלף</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MI')\"><reflink>MI</reflink></lookup>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('SI')\"><reflink>SI</reflink></lookup>, Sabean <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('DHM')\">DHM<sup>ZMG 1875, 615</sup></lookup>; Arabic <placeholder237/>, Aramaic <placeholder238/>, <bdbheb>אֲלַף</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>אלפיא</bdbheb>) — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>) א</bdbheb><bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>(אָ֑</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 20:16\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(1,20,16)\">Gen 20:16</ref> +; suffix <bdbheb>אַלְפִּי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 6:15\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(7,6,15)\">Judg 6:15</ref> dual <bdbheb>אַלְפַּיִם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 4:36\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(4,4,36)\">Num 4:36</ref> +; plural <bdbheb>אֲלָפִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 18:21\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(2,18,21)\">Exod 18:21</ref> +; construct <bdbheb>אַלְפֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 32:28\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(2,32,28)\">Exod 32:28</ref> +; <bdbheb>אֲלָפֶיךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 7:13\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(5,7,13)\">Deut 7:13</ref> + 2 t.; <bdbheb>אֲלָפָיו</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> <ref ref=\"1Sam 18:7\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(9,18,7)\">1Sam 18:7</ref> + 2 t. (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> <bdbheb>פֿו</bdbheb>) — <highlight>a thousand.</highlight> <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> numeral: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> used with noun alone; mostly before noun <ref ref=\"Num 35:4\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(4,35,4)\">Num 35:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 7:3\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(6,7,3)\">Josh 7:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 3:13\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(16,3,13)\">Neh 3:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 18:4\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(13,18,4)\">1Chr 18:4</ref> +; after noun (late) <ref ref=\"1Chr 12:35\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(13,12,35)\">1Chr 12:35</ref> + 6 t. Chronicles Ezra Nehemiah; <bdbheb>בָּאַפָּה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 35:5\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(4,35,5)\">Num 35:5</ref> (4 t. in verse); <ref ref=\"Ezek 47:3\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(26,47,3)\">Ezek 47:3</ref> (strike out <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup>); the noun always plural when preceding, sometimes when following, <ref ref=\"1Sam 25:2\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(9,25,2)\">1Sam 25:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 3:4\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(11,3,4)\">1Kgs 3:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 18:23\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(12,18,23)\">2Kgs 18:23</ref> = <ref ref=\"Isa 36:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,36,8)\">Isa 36:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 30:24\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(14,30,24)\">2Chr 30:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 90:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"90\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"90\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,90,4)\">Ps 90:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 42:12\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(18,42,12)\">Job 42:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Eccl 6:6\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(21,6,6)\">Eccl 6:6</ref> elsewhere singular <bdbheb>אישׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 9:49\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"49\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"49\" onclick=\"bcv(7,9,49)\">Judg 9:49</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 15:15\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(7,15,15)\">Judg 15:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 15:16\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(7,15,16)\">Judg 15:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 7:3\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(6,7,3)\">Josh 7:3</ref> +; <bdbheb>אַמָּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 35:4\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(4,35,4)\">Num 35:4</ref> + (so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('SI')\"><reflink>SI</reflink></lookup>); <bdbheb>דּוֺר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 7:9\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(5,7,9)\">Deut 7:9</ref> +, compare <ref ref=\"1Chr 18:4\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(13,18,4)\">1Chr 18:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 19:6\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(13,19,6)\">1Chr 19:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 15:19\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(12,15,19)\">2Kgs 15:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 42:12\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(18,42,12)\">Job 42:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Song 4:4\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(22,4,4)\">Song 4:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 7:23\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(23,7,23)\">Isa 7:23</ref>, noun sometimes collective; <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> plural construct <ref ref=\"Mic 6:7\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(33,6,7)\">Mic 6:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 119:72\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"72\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"72\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,72)\">Ps 119:72</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 24:60\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"60\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"60\" onclick=\"bcv(1,24,60)\">Gen 24:60</ref> noun not expressed (or not fully) <ref ref=\"Gen 20:16\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(1,20,16)\">Gen 20:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 31:5\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(4,31,5)\">Num 31:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 31:6\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(4,31,6)\">Num 31:6</ref> +; distributive <bdbheb>אֶלֶף ֗֗֗ אֶלֶף</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 31:4\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(4,31,4)\">Num 31:4</ref> multiplicative <ref ref=\"Deut 1:11\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(5,1,11)\">Deut 1:11</ref> <bdbheb>פְּעָמִים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb>; indefinite for great number (plural) <ref ref=\"Exod 20:6\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(2,20,6)\">Exod 20:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 34:7\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(2,34,7)\">Exod 34:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 5:10\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(5,5,10)\">Deut 5:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 32:18\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(24,32,18)\">Jer 32:18</ref>, (singular) <ref ref=\"Deut 32:30\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(5,32,30)\">Deut 32:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"Eccl 6:6\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(21,6,6)\">Eccl 6:6</ref> +. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> + other number usually precedes it <ref ref=\"Exod 38:25\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(2,38,25)\">Exod 38:25</ref> + often; but following <bdbheb>רִבּוֺא</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezra 2:64\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"64\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"64\" onclick=\"bcv(15,2,64)\">Ezra 2:64</ref> + 2 t.; it follows also smaller number <ref ref=\"Num 3:50\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"50\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"50\" onclick=\"bcv(4,3,50)\">Num 3:50</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 5:12\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(11,5,12)\">1Kgs 5:12</ref> (so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('SI')\"><reflink>SI</reflink></lookup>); the noun following in singular <ref ref=\"Exod 28:25\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(2,28,25)\">Exod 28:25</ref> + 8 t.; plural <ref ref=\"2Sam 8:4\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(10,8,4)\">2Sam 8:4</ref> + 2 t.; noun precedes, in plural (late) <ref ref=\"Dan 12:12\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(27,12,12)\">Dan 12:12</ref> + 2 t.; noun not expressed <ref ref=\"Exod 38:28\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(2,38,28)\">Exod 38:28</ref> + often <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> X other number always following <ref ref=\"Exod 12:37\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(2,12,37)\">Exod 12:37</ref> +; usual order is <highlight>no.</highlight> X <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> + <highlight>additional no.</highlight> (if any) + <highlight>noun</highlight> (if expressed) <ref ref=\"Num 31:52\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"52\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"52\" onclick=\"bcv(4,31,52)\">Num 31:52</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 20:35\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(7,20,35)\">Judg 20:35</ref> compare <ref ref=\"Exod 12:37\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(2,12,37)\">Exod 12:37</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 3:4\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(12,3,4)\">2Kgs 3:4</ref> (twice in verse) +; less often <highlight>noun</highlight> + <highlight>no.</highlight> X <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 31:33\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(4,31,33)\">Num 31:33</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:63\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"63\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"63\" onclick=\"bcv(11,8,63)\">1Kgs 8:63</ref> +; (other combinations see <ref ref=\"Exod 38:26\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(2,38,26)\">Exod 38:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 26:51\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"51\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"51\" onclick=\"bcv(4,26,51)\">Num 26:51</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 31:32\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(4,31,32)\">Num 31:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 48:30\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(26,48,30)\">Ezek 48:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 29:7\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(13,29,7)\">1Chr 29:7</ref> etc.); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> usually singular <ref ref=\"Num 11:21\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(4,11,21)\">Num 11:21</ref> +; except after units, where plural absolute <ref ref=\"Num 1:46\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"46\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"46\" onclick=\"bcv(4,1,46)\">Num 1:46</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 20:34\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(7,20,34)\">Judg 20:34</ref> + (so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MI')\"><reflink>MI</reflink></lookup>); seldom plural construct <ref ref=\"Exod 32:28\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(2,32,28)\">Exod 32:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 4:10\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(7,4,10)\">Judg 4:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 1:3\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(18,1,3)\">Job 1:3</ref> (twice in verse); (noun mostly singular when following <ref ref=\"Judg 4:10\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(7,4,10)\">Judg 4:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 12:21\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(11,12,21)\">1Kgs 12:21</ref>+, yet plural <ref ref=\"Josh 4:13\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(6,4,13)\">Josh 4:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 13:5\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(9,13,5)\">1Sam 13:5</ref> +; when preceding it is plural <ref ref=\"1Chr 5:21\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(13,5,21)\">1Chr 5:21</ref> +, or collective <ref ref=\"Num 31:33\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(4,31,33)\">Num 31:33</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 25:2\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(9,25,2)\">1Sam 25:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:63\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"63\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"63\" onclick=\"bcv(11,8,63)\">1Kgs 8:63</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 7:5\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(14,7,5)\">2Chr 7:5</ref> +); <bdbheb>אֶלֶף אֲלָפִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 21:5\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(13,21,5)\">1Chr 21:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 22:14\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(13,22,14)\">1Chr 22:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 14:8\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(14,14,8)\">2Chr 14:8</ref> <bdbheb>אַלְפֵי שִׁנְאָן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 68:18\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"68\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"68\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(19,68,18)\">Ps 68:18</ref>, compare <bdbheb>שִׁנְאָן</bdbheb>; <bdbheb>בְּהַרֲרֵי אָ֑לֶף</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 50:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,50,10)\">Ps 50:10</ref>, read <bdbheb>אֵל</bdbheb> compare <ref ref=\"Ps 36:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,36,7)\">Ps 36:7</ref>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ol')\">Ol</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bi')\">Bi</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Che')\">Che</lookup>; yet see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hup')\">Hup</lookup> De. — </p></div><div class=\"section\"><p></div><div class=\"remarks\"><b>Note.</b> 10,000 = <bdbheb>עֲשֶׂרֶת אֲלָפִים</bdbheb> etc. <ref ref=\"Judg 1:4\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(7,1,4)\">Judg 1:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 3:29\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(7,3,29)\">Judg 3:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 5:28\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(11,5,28)\">1Kgs 5:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 29:7\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(13,29,7)\">1Chr 29:7</ref> +; less often <bdbheb>רִבּוֺ</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>רְבָבָה</bdbheb> etc. q. v. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>a thousand</highlight>, a company of 1000 men, as united under one superior, or leader, hence <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>(שָׂרֵי) שַׂר א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 18:21\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(2,18,21)\">Exod 18:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 18:25\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(2,18,25)\">Exod 18:25</ref> compare <ref ref=\"Num 31:14\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(4,31,14)\">Num 31:14</ref> +; compare <bdbheb>יִשְׂרָאֵל</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>רָאשֵׁי א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 1:16\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(4,1,16)\">Num 1:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 10:4\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(4,10,4)\">Num 10:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 22:21\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(6,22,21)\">Josh 22:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 22:30\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(6,22,30)\">Josh 22:30</ref> &amp; see below; compare also <ref ref=\"1Sam 29:2\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(9,29,2)\">1Sam 29:2</ref> especially <highlight>family</highlight>, etc. <ref ref=\"Judg 6:15\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(7,6,15)\">Judg 6:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 10:19\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(9,10,19)\">1Sam 10:19</ref> (|| <bdbheb>שֵׁבֶט</bdbheb> &amp; compare <bdbheb>מִשְׁפַּחַת</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"1Sam 10:21\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(9,10,21)\">1Sam 10:21</ref>); compare <ref ref=\"Mic 5:2\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(33,5,2)\">Mic 5:2</ref> — <ref ref=\"Num 10:36\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(4,10,36)\">Num 10:36</ref> (<bdbheb>רִבְבוֺת אַלְפֵי יִשְׂרָאֵל</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Num 31:5\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(4,31,5)\">Num 31:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 22:14\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(6,22,14)\">Josh 22:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 23:23\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(9,23,23)\">1Sam 23:23</ref> apparently shew transition to this technical use. <b>**</b>[<bdbheb>אָלַף</bdbheb>] <b>verb denominative Hiph`il</b> <ref ref=\"Ps 144:13\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"144\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"144\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(19,144,13)\">Ps 144:13</ref> <bdbheb>מַאֲלִיפוֺת</bdbheb> <highlight>producing thousands</highlight> (subject <bdbheb>צאֹן</bdbheb>). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Judg 6:15", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 6, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Gen 20:16", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 20, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Num 4:36", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 4, "verse": 36}, {"raw": "Exod 18:21", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 18, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Exod 32:28", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 32, "verse": 28}, {"raw": "Deut 7:13", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 7,